## 7. Soundscape Mode & Preferences

### **useLocalPreferences.ts**
**Location:** `/Users/akinpound/Documents/experiments/storia-mobile/hooks/useLocalPreferences.ts`
**Lines:** 1-56

Manages user preferences including soundscape behavior.

**Default Settings:**
